  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 2 December 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside 8 Astrolabe Place, you will instantly feel the warmth, quality, and care that makes this home so special. Truly loved and meticulously maintained, this solid, single-level brick and tile residence effortlessly ticks every box for easy coastal living.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home lies a bright, open-plan living space designed around effortless connection. The generous kitchen offers plenty of counter space and premium room for the home chef to whip up family feasts, flowing seamlessly into the dining and main living areas. From here, doors open out to an undercover courtyard - the ultimate spot to savor your morning coffee or relax with evening drinks. For families needing a bit of extra space, the added bonus of a second separate lounge provides a quiet sanctuary for movie nights, reading, or a dedicated kids' playroom.\r\n\r\nLocated just down the hallway, you’ll find four well-appointed bedrooms, offering restful retreats for everyone in the family. The spacious master bedroom serves as your own private haven, complete with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while thoughtful storage solutions throughout the home ensure clutter is never a concern.\r\n\r\nPracticality is covered too, with a spacious double garage featuring internal access, alongside ample off-street parking.\r\n\r\nStep outside, and the low-maintenance grounds open up into a true paradise for garden lovers and foodies alike. You can wander out to pick fresh fruit straight from your own backyard orchard - boasting orange, tangerine, guava, nectarine, peach, plum, lime, lemon, mandarin, feijoa, and grapes - or plant your favorite herbs in the multiple raised vegetable boxes scattered around the property.\r\n\r\nNestled in a quiet, family-friendly cul-de-sac, the location puts the best of Gulf Harbour right on your doorstep. You are just minutes from the Gulf Harbour Marina with its stress-free ferry commute to Auckland CBD, local golfing at Whangaparaoa Golf Club, and the stunning beaches and walking trails of Shakespear Regional Park. Families will also appreciate the excellent schooling options nearby, with the home in zone for Gulf Harbour School and Whangaparaoa College, and within easy reach of Wentworth Primary and College.\r\n\r\nThis is the move-in ready, single-level home you have been waiting for - where all the hard work is done, and a relaxed lifestyle awaits.",
